{
  "about": "Hand-computed ranking measures (spec 041, 3.4.3 and 3.4.4). D[i] is entry i of discounts.json. relevant_at_least is 1 and gain linear unless a case says otherwise. A mean is num/den, computed as one binary64 division; an nDCG value is given as its bit pattern.",
